            <div class="bio-photo-col">
              <div class="bio-photo">
                <img
                  src="/lovable-uploads/dra-carla-jaleco-bracos-cruzados.webp"
                  alt="Dr. Carla Christoph - Dental Specialist"
                  width="800"
                  height="1200"
                  loading="lazy"
                  decoding="async"
                />
                <div class="bio-badge">20+ Years of Experience</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bio-card">
              <div class="bio-head">
                <h3>Dr. Carla Christoph</h3>
                <p class="bio-sub">CRO-RJ 27.509 | Specialist in Prosthodontics and Implant Dentistry</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bio-paras">
                <p>With over two decades in Ipanema, Dr. Carla has built her reputation by treating each patient individually, with time and attention. Her background includes 8 years as a military dentist at the Brazilian Navy Dental Center, an experience that brought discipline and precision to her clinical practice.</p>
                <p>For restorations, she uses resins and ceramics that reproduce the natural translucency of each tooth. The goal is for the restoration to go completely unnoticed — making the treated tooth indistinguishable from the rest.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bio-creds">
                <div class="bio-creds-grid">
                  <div class="bio-cred">
                    <svg class="cred-check" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--dental-gold)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
                    <div><p class="cred-t">Training</p><p class="cred-d">Specialist in Dental Prosthetics and Implantology</p></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bio-cred">
                    <svg class="cred-check" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--dental-gold)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
                    <div><p class="cred-t">Experience</p><p class="cred-d">20+ years treating cases of all complexities</p></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bio-cred">
                    <svg class="cred-check" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--dental-gold)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
                    <div><p class="cred-t">Continuing Education</p><p class="cred-d">Ongoing training in advanced techniques</p></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bio-cred">
                    <svg class="cred-check" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--dental-gold)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
                    <div><p class="cred-t">Technology</p><p class="cred-d">iTero Element 5D intraoral scanner</p></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
