          <p>Each technique has specific indications. The choice depends on the extent of damage, tooth location, and treatment goals.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="modal-grid">
          <!-- CARD 1 - DIRECT -->
          <div class="modal-card">
            <div class="modal-img">
              <img src="/lovable-uploads/Restauracao direta.webp" alt="Direct Composite Resin Restoration" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div class="modal-overlay"></div>
              <div class="modal-caption">
                <h3>Direct Composite Restoration</h3>
                <p>Completed in a single office visit</p>
