              <div class="ind-block">
                <h4>Indications:</h4>
                <ul class="ind-list">
                  <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--dental-gold)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg><span>Small to medium cavities</span></li>
                  <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--dental-gold)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg><span>Minor fractures</span></li>
                  <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--dental-gold)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg><span>Surface cracks</span></li>
                  <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--dental-gold)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg><span>Closing small gaps (diastemas)</span></li>
                  <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--dental-gold)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg><span>Shape correction</span></li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <details class="acc-item modal-acc">
                <summary>See Detailed Characteristics<svg class="acc-chev" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
                <div class="acc-body char-rows">
                  <div class="char-row"><span class="char-k">Fabrication:</span><span class="char-v">In-office (1 session)</span></div>
                  <div class="char-row"><span class="char-k">Duration:</span><span class="char-v">40-90 minutes per tooth</span></div>
                  <div class="char-row"><span class="char-k">Longevity:</span><span class="char-v">5-8 years</span></div>
                  <div class="char-row"><span class="char-k">Investment:</span><span class="char-v">More accessible</span></div>
                  <div class="char-row"><span class="char-k">Preparation:</span><span class="char-v">Minimally conservative</span></div>
                </div>
              </details>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- CARD 2 - INDIRECT -->
          <div class="modal-card">
            <div class="modal-img">
              <img src="/lovable-uploads/inlay de porcelana.webp" alt="Indirect Restoration - Porcelain Inlay and Onlay" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div class="modal-overlay"></div>
              <div class="modal-caption">
                <h3>Indirect Restoration (Inlay/Onlay)</h3>
                <p>Fabricated in a specialized dental lab</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
              <p class="modal-desc">Fabricated in a specialized lab and cemented in a second session, offering greater strength and longevity.</p>
              <div class="ind-block">
                <h4>Indications:</h4>
                <ul class="ind-list">
                  <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--dental-gold)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg><span>Extensive cavities</span></li>
                  <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--dental-gold)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg><span>Significant structural loss</span></li>
                  <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--dental-gold)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg><span>Large fractures in back teeth</span></li>
                  <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--dental-gold)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg><span>Replacement of large old restorations</span></li>
                  <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--dental-gold)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg><span>Maximum durability required</span></li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <details class="acc-item modal-acc">
                <summary>See Detailed Characteristics<svg class="acc-chev" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
                <div class="acc-body char-rows">
                  <div class="char-row"><span class="char-k">Fabrication:</span><span class="char-v">Lab-crafted (2 sessions)</span></div>
                  <div class="char-row"><span class="char-k">Material:</span><span class="char-v">Porcelain or lab-processed resin</span></div>
