          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What is an aesthetic dental restoration?<svg class="acc-chev" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
            <div class="faq-body"><p>It is a procedure that rebuilds teeth compromised by cavities, fractures, or cracks using state-of-the-art materials (composite resin or porcelain) that perfectly mimic the color, shine, and texture of natural teeth. Unlike the old dark amalgam "fillings," aesthetic restorations are virtually invisible.</p></div>
