            <summary>What materials are used in aesthetic restorations?<svg class="acc-chev" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
            <div class="faq-body"><p>We use state-of-the-art nano-filled composite resins that offer high strength, natural aesthetics, and durability. For cases requiring maximum longevity (large posterior restorations), we recommend porcelain or lab-processed resin restorations (inlays/onlays), which are fabricated in specialized labs for even greater strength.</p></div>
