          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>How long do aesthetic restorations last?<svg class="acc-chev" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary>
